  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development to which this permission relates must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of the decision notice. \rReason: To comply with the provisions of S.51 of the Planning & Compulsory Purchase Act 2004.\r",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the approved plans, as set out in the attached schedule which forms part of this notice. \rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "Notwithstanding the details shown on the approved drawings, the external materials of the single-storey extensions at Nos. 11 and 13 Solna Road shall match in colour, texture, and finish those of the existing host dwellings.\r\rThe external materials of the outbuilding, pergola, decking, and boundary fence shall be carried out in accordance with the approved drawings.\r\rReason: To ensure that the extensions integrate appropriately with the host dwellings and that all ancillary structures are completed in accordance with the approved details, in the interests of the character and appearance of the host properties and the surrounding area, in accordance with Policies DMD6, DMD11, DMD12, and DMD37 of the Development Management Document.",
    "The outbuilding hereby approved shall be used solely for purposes ancillary or incidental to the residential use of the host dwelling and shall not be used for any separate residential accommodation, self-contained living unit, or for any business, commercial, or industrial purposes.\r\rReason: To ensure that the outbuilding remains ancillary to the main dwelling and to protect the amenities of neighbouring properties and the character of the area, in accordance with Policies DMD6, DMD12, and DMD37 of the Development Management Document."
  ],
